        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "晓得",
        "text_free": "但是你晓得没有，这个油炸食品吃多了，对身体是有害的不？"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "start": 20.432,
      "end": 26.201,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "下面我就来和大家讲一讲这个油炸食品吃多了有哪些坏处。",
      "score": 0.0549,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0011,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0016,
        "sc_delta": -0.0004,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.12,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "下面啊，我就来和大家讲一讲这个油炸食品吃多了有哪些犯错。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "start": 26.932,
      "end": 30.974,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "一、油炸的东西吃的越多，心脏病风险越大。",
      "score": 0.0269,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0111,
